| [Complete lecture note](07-study/lecture-full.yamd) | All study features used together in one real note | Available |

## Folder layout

```text
examples/
  getting-started.yamd      guided tour of the basics
  refs.bib                  bibliography used by the citation examples
  assets/                   images used by the examples
  01-basics/                core syntax
  02-documents/             document-level features
  03-notes/                 linked notes
  04-databases/             databases and queries
    data/                   tasks.ydb, projects.ydb, crm.sqlite
  05-kanban/                kanban boards
    data/                   roadmap.ydb
  06-markdown/              moving from Markdown
  07-study/                 study features: flashcards, deadlines, citations, export
    refs.bib                bibliography used by the citation example
    lecture-full.yamd       a complete lecture note using every study feature
```
